abstract: >-
  Unity project for TMT-VR, a virtual-reality version of the Trail Making Test
  (Parts A and B) for the HTC VIVE Focus Vision. Release 1.1.0 contains four
  apps: head-direction and controller-ray pointing, each in English and Greek,
  each built as an Android APK for the standalone headset and as a Windows
  64-bit PC VR build. The controller apps include a passive motion logger that records events and
  poses only.
